]{name=takeaways, column=1, span=2, between=row18 and bottom}{
  \fontsize{20}{26}\selectfont\color{textwhite}
  \begin{minipage}[t]{0.47\linewidth}
    \begin{enumerate}[itemsep=8pt]
      \item Bot traffic $\approx$ {\bfseries half of all requests} to academic publisher websites
      \item Multi-stage CDN-edge verification blocks {\bfseries vast majority of malicious bots} with minimal human impact
    \end{enumerate}
  \end{minipage}\hfill
  \begin{minipage}[t]{0.47\linewidth}
    \begin{enumerate}[itemsep=8pt, start=3]
      \item Traceable identifiers (Ray IDs) enable {\bfseries continuous optimization} of the security--usability balance
      \item Publisher--CDN collaboration is {\bfseries critical} for sustaining open, secure access to scientific knowledge
    \end{enumerate}
  \end{minipage}
}

